# UI / design

Read `DESIGN.md` before changing UI. It describes the live application, not a generic shadcn theme.

Keep these scoped rules when they attach:

- `.cursor/rules/app-page-shell.mdc` for new `app/**/page.tsx` shells
- `.cursor/rules/tabs-styling.mdc` for tab lists

Do not treat Inventory mobile chrome, Workshop’s hand-rolled header, or tablet-mode experiments as the default page recipe. Named references and anti-patterns are in `DESIGN.md`.
